5. ONNX models (Beat This! and Open-Unmix)

   The Automix feature optionally uses two quantized neural-network
   models distributed as ONNX files:

   • beat_this_int8.onnx
     Derived from CPJKU/beat_this (https://github.com/CPJKU/beat_this)
     Copyright (c) CPJKU / Johannes Kepler University Linz
     License: MIT

   • vocals_umxhq_int8.onnx
     Derived from sigsep/open-unmix (https://github.com/sigsep/open-unmix)
     Copyright (c) Inria / SigSep
     License: MIT

   Both are redistributed under the MIT License, whose full text
   appears in section 4 above. The models are optional: Aurelis works
   without them, falling back to the pure-DSP analyzer.

